## Command

```shell
biome inspect plugins
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "plugins": [
    { "path": "./rules", "includes": ["**/*.ts"] },
    "./rules/foo.grit"
  ]
}
```

## `rules/biome-manifest.json`

```json
{ "version": 1, "plugins": { "rules": [{ "foo": "foo.grit", "alias": "foo.grit" }] } }
```

## `rules/foo.grit`

```grit
`unterminated
```

